{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52754","headline":"缺题 · 张子容","name":"缺题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"在家娇小女，卷[幔]（慢）爱花丛。\n不畏罗衣湿，折花风雨中。\n（见《四部丛刊》本《後邨先生大全集》卷一七七《诗话续集》引李康成《玉台後集》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张子容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}